<h1 class="heading">Reset your password</h1>
<p class="subheading">
  Hi <strong>{{firstName}}</strong>, we received a request to reset your password.
  Click the button below to choose a new one.
</p>

<div class="btn-wrapper">
  <a href="{{resetUrl}}" class="btn btn-danger">Reset Password</a>
</div>

<div class="warning-box">
  <strong>⚠ This link expires in 1 hour.</strong><br/>
  If you did not request a password reset, please ignore this email.
  Your password will not change.
</div>

<div class="info-box">
  <strong>For your security:</strong><br/>
  This link can only be used once. After resetting, all active sessions will be signed out.
</div>

<hr class="divider"/>

<p class="fallback">
  Button not working? Copy and paste this URL into your browser:<br/>
  <a href="{{resetUrl}}">{{resetUrl}}</a>
</p>